          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">More Than Best Friends</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When Catra is banished from the Horde, she wants nothing to do with anyone or anything. But then she gets trapped in a magic building with her ex best friend Adora, who just so happens to also be the legendary princess She-Ra, and she realizes that nothing can keep the two apart. They learn about love from the world of princesses and grow closer than ever.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>kerryberry</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
